{"title":"2020 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A bag contains letters as shown. \n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Elina randomly chooses one of the letters from the bag. What is the probability that Elina chooses a B?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/4/ff48d246d478fcdd05b5806824075eb9880014aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac14 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac12 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac43 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac34 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"371\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Counting, we see that there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> letters in the bag and that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> are B. This means that the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Probability\" title=\"Probability\">probability</a> of choosing a B when choosing a random letter from the bag would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/9/33980afecb9562ff64caf9965adfd2045f949de2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" />, which simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/3/ad31de7ea30460370d4f5327a9d5ce75231c51fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(A) } \\frac14}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"62\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2020 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2020 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by